 34CL5cL +A{+2}{-L+2}(d|s/d|W){-macro}{+L+2}|3, where |a=1/3 for (d,|a)         
 34CL6cL reactions and |a=2J+1 for (|a,d) reactions on J{-i}=0 nuclei           
